  "description": "The Ragley Blue Pig Race takes hardcore trail riding to the next level. With more suspension travel and an exceptional component spec, this bike is ideal for all-mountain explorations, hardtail enduro racing, demanding singletrack terrains and daring descents. Plus, it's equipped with a RockShox Lyrik 160mm travel suspension fork, a Shimano SLX 12-Speed groupset and Nukeproof Horizon tubeless ready wheels.\nIf you have heard of Ragley, you already know the Blue Pig name. From the early days of the ‘hardcore hardtail’ it has pushed the geometry envelope and been loved by anyone who rides for all-out grin-inducing fun.\nThe Blue Pig Race takes the best bits from the standard Blue Pig and gives it another shot of adrenalin.\nRockShox Lyrik 160mm Suspension Forks and Shimano SLX 12-Speed Groupset\nThe Race version gets an additional 10mm of travel from a RockShox Lyrik RC, slackening out the head angle and making it even more capable on the rough stuff. Other upgrades include a full SLX 12-speed groupset and Nukeproof’s new Horizon wheelset, now used by their multiple EWS winning race team.\nGet your weight down, spot the turn, keep off the brakes and let it fly. The only limitation here is your bottle.",
